  "bodyHash": "caeb709b6204ff94",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Universal Enchants</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 扩展了《我的世界》的附魔系统，允许附魔作用于更多物品，移除了不必要的兼容性限制，并对多项原版附魔进行了优化。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为什么只有剑才能享受乐趣？将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔到三叉戟 🔱、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔到弩 🏹、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔到斧头 🪓，或将保护类附魔应用到动物盔甲 🛡️ 上吧。本模组在忠于原版玩法的同时，为你开启了无数种全新的搭配组合。⚔️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">除了扩展兼容性外，多项附魔还获得了实用的体验优化。 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔真正实现了无限使用 ♾️、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">效率</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔能额外奖励经验值 💎、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔变得更加高效 🎯，等等。每一项改动均可单独进行配置 ⚙️，让你能够打造出最契合你世界的附魔系统。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多武器获得更多附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 斧头、三叉戟、锤、弓、弩、盾牌及其他装备现在可以应用许多原先无法使用的附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">扩展远程战斗能力：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可在弓上应用 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速装填</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，或在弩上应用 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">力量</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">强化三叉戟与锤：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">击退</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 等附魔应用于这些武器，打造强力的全新搭配。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔动物盔甲：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 马铠、狼铠和鹦鹉螺壳盔甲现在可以享受多项护甲附魔的加成，包括 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰霜行者</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灵魂疾行</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">荆棘</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">减少附魔冲突限制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 默认情况下， </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">经验修补</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 以及 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> + </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿透</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 等热门搭配已兼容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可选伤害附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可配置让 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">锋利</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 与 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">亡灵杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">节肢杀手</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿刺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">破甲</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 同时生效，而非互斥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可选防护附魔叠加：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 允许在同一件装备上将 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 与 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">爆炸保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">弹射物保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 合并使用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">优化原版附魔：</span></strong> <em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔不再需要消耗多余的箭矢，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抢夺</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">效率</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔可提升经验掉落，</span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">摔落保护</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔可防止耕地被踩坏，且 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">多重射击</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 附魔因移除了弹射物免疫而更加强力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完全可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有兼容性更改与附魔调整均可通过数据包进行单独的开启、关闭或自定义设置。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 已安装（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模组支持，可直接在游戏中通过模组菜单进行配置（Fabric 版需安装 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，该模组由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 提供）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，具体取决于配置类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组附带多个可选数据包，用于扩展现有附魔可应用的物品范围，并启用新的附魔组合。每个数据包专注于特定的物品组或附魔组，且可独立控制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">创建世界时可在 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">数据包</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 界面中启用或禁用这些数据包，也可在已有世界或多玩家服务器中通过 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/datapack</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 指令进行管理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">详细的文档说明、所有内置数据包的完整参考指南，以及本模组提供的额外数据包功能信息，均可在 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 文件中找到。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-ai-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/skeletonaifix/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-finder\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/deathfinder/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stylisheffects/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
